{"title": "ED launches probe into TMC funds, raids multiple locations in Bengal", "summary": "The Enforcement Directorate (ED) has launched a probe into alleged irregularities in the financial transactions of the Trinamool Congress (TMC), raiding multiple locations in West Bengal. The ED's actions come amid allegations of money laundering and corruption linked to the TMC. The raids are part of an ongoing investigation into the party's alleged misuse of funds.", "summary_points": ["The ED has launched a probe into alleged irregularities in the financial transactions of the Trinamool Congress (TMC).", "Multiple locations in West Bengal have been raided by the ED as part of the investigation.", "The ED's actions come amid allegations of money laundering and corruption linked to the TMC.", "The raids are part of an ongoing investigation into the party's alleged misuse of funds.", "The probe is being conducted under the Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA)."], "title_hi": "एड लॉन्च करता है टीएमसी फंड मामले, बंगाल में कई स्थानों पर छापे", "summary_hi": "एडने टीएमसी फंड मामले में एक निगरानी शुरू की, बंगाल में कई स्थानों पर छापे मारे। एड की कार्रवाई पीडब्ल्यूडी के आरोपों का जवाब देने के लिए की गई है, जिसमें टीएमसी के फंड्स में धोखाधड़ी का आरोप लगाया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["एडने टीएमसी फंड मामले में एक निगरानी शुरू की।", "बंगाल में कई स्थानों पर छापे मारे।", "एड की कार्रवाई पीडब्ल्यूडी के आरोपों का जवाब देने के लिए की गई है।", "टीएमसी के फंड्स में धोखाधड़ी का आरोप लगाया गया है।", "निगरानी प्रवर्तन में अधिनियम (पीडब्ल्यूडी) के तहत की जा रही है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the alleged misuse of funds by the TMC and the ED's actions as a response to these allegations. They also highlight the ongoing investigation and the potential for further action."], "center": ["Centrist coverage frames the story as a probe into alleged irregularities in the TMC's financial transactions, with an emphasis on the ED's actions and the ongoing investigation. They do not take a clear stance on the allegations or the ED's response."], "right": ["Right-leaning outlets focus on the ED's actions as a crackdown on corruption and money laundering linked to the TMC, emphasizing the potential for further action and the need for accountability."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["टीएमसी के फंड्स में धोखाधड़ी का आरोप लगाने और एड की कार्रवाई को जवाब देने के लिए एड की कार्रवाई पर जोर देते हैं।"], "center": ["केंद्रीय समाचार टीएमसी के फंड्स में धोखाधड़ी का आरोप लगाने और एड की कार्रवाई पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं, लेकिन इनमें से कोई भी पक्ष नहीं लेते।"], "right": ["टीएमसी से जुड़े धन Laundering और धोखाधड़ी पर एड की कार्रवाई को उजागर करते हैं।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYWMzYzEwNjgwLTdhMjItMTFmMS1hZmFlLTJkNzNlMTMwYzExYi5qcGc=", "sources": [{"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "ED Raids Five Places in Kolkata in Suspected Rs 150 Crore Fund Routing Case"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "ED searches in TMC bank accounts ‘suspect’ funds case"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPSTUtdlJmUVd0YVk2X1pQYzREY3UwWDVsMXJ1LU9GWDA3MURyTVZST0s2TDdKZE44c3ZsSHctSHVtVUhLTDJnb2xCRTV1bzViT2tla1ktNm1fR01raFBQYS15NEJWWFRMRlFGRFY2NUhjUVV4Sm96MDBiOHhDMml3MGstU1_SAYoBQVVfeXFMTmxIRzM2bVNYRVB4ekw2VTlvY3oxNDA5bng5Zy1UTnMxRXhVb3FwLU1kM1I1NWlvLWZRS0Q2akJ6WUdfVW9SekpoRDVIZXZnXzJsazNhT0VUMzZsNDBfMU9NbDJGNkpjNnFUNDMwTFJSWDNDdDNBdU1SNWhXeVRfS0MzQ29EWUJwRUFR?oc=5", "headline": "ED searches in TMC bank accounts funds case"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "owner": "ABP Group